### WD-5136 — Optimization/optimizeRoutes
# Calcula las rutas que visitan referencias del catálogo con las unidades indicadas, con el
# mismo motor de Optimizaciones de Reactive (calles, ventanas, descansos y zonas de
# restricción de pesados del operador). No guarda nada: para guardar, saveRoutes.
# Ids de Desarrollo, organización 229: Bodega Central 4202, Adriatika 4074,
# Walmart Arkadia 4133, TacoBell Z15 4135, Paseo Cayalá 4152; unidades 2361, 2362, 2363.
# Las horas van en hora local "HH:mm". Errores: 400 = 1011, 500 = 1004.

### 1) Básico: menos unidades (consolidar, por defecto), ventana en Adriatika
POST {{baseUrl}}/Optimization/optimizeRoutes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originLocationId": 4202,
  "unitIds": [2361, 2362, 2363],
  "stops": [
    { "locationId": 4074, "timeWindowStart": "09:00", "timeWindowEnd": "11:00" },
    { "locationId": 4133 },
    { "locationId": 4135 }
  ]
}

### 2) Menor distancia total
POST {{baseUrl}}/Optimization/optimizeRoutes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originLocationId": 4202,
  "unitIds": [2361, 2362, 2363],
  "objective": "distancia",
  "stops": [{ "locationId": 4074 }, { "locationId": 4133 }, { "locationId": 4135 }]
}

### 3) Jornadas parejas: reparte entre unidades, una ruta por unidad
POST {{baseUrl}}/Optimization/optimizeRoutes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originLocationId": 4202,
  "unitIds": [2361, 2362, 2363],
  "objective": "balancear",
  "stops": [{ "locationId": 4074 }, { "locationId": 4133 }, { "locationId": 4135 }]
}

### 4) Jornada, visita por defecto y descanso del conductor (30 min tras 1 h)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Optimization/optimizeRoutes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originLocationId": 4202,
  "unitIds": [2361],
  "workdayStart": "07:30",
  "workdayHours": 9,
  "defaultVisitMinutes": 45,
  "restAfterHours": 1,
  "restDurationMinutes": 30,
  "stops": [{ "locationId": 4074 }, { "locationId": 4133 }, { "locationId": 4135 }]
}

### 5) Destino propio: todas las rutas terminan en Paseo Cayalá
POST {{baseUrl}}/Optimization/optimizeRoutes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originLocationId": 4202,
  "destinationLocationId": 4152,
  "unitIds": [2361, 2362, 2363],
  "stops": [{ "locationId": 4074 }, { "locationId": 4133 }, { "locationId": 4135 }]
}

### 6) Parada opcional que no cabe en la jornada → queda en unassignedLocationIds
POST {{baseUrl}}/Optimization/optimizeRoutes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originLocationId": 4202,
  "unitIds": [2361],
  "workdayHours": 3,
  "stops": [
    { "locationId": 4074 },
    { "locationId": 4133 },
    { "locationId": 4135, "priority": "optional", "visitDurationMinutes": 600 }
  ]
}

### 7) Ventanas que no se pueden cumplir juntas → softTimeWindows = true
POST {{baseUrl}}/Optimization/optimizeRoutes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originLocationId": 4202,
  "unitIds": [2361],
  "stops": [
    { "locationId": 4074, "timeWindowStart": "08:30", "timeWindowEnd": "09:00", "visitDurationMinutes": 30 },
    { "locationId": 4135, "timeWindowStart": "08:30", "timeWindowEnd": "09:05", "visitDurationMinutes": 30 }
  ]
}

### 8) Otra organización del usuario (multiorganización)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Optimization/optimizeRoutes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "organizationId": 229,
  "originLocationId": 4202,
  "unitIds": [2361],
  "stops": [{ "locationId": 4074 }]
}

### 9) 400: el origen también está en stops
POST {{baseUrl}}/Optimization/optimizeRoutes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originLocationId": 4202,
  "unitIds": [2361],
  "stops": [{ "locationId": 4074 }, { "locationId": 4202 }]
}

### 10) 400: unidad de otra organización
POST {{baseUrl}}/Optimization/optimizeRoutes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originLocationId": 4202,
  "unitIds": [1],
  "stops": [{ "locationId": 4074 }]
}

### 11) 400: organización sin acceso
POST {{baseUrl}}/Optimization/optimizeRoutes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "organizationId": 999999,
  "originLocationId": 4202,
  "unitIds": [2361],
  "stops": [{ "locationId": 4074 }]
}

### 12) 400: referencia sin ruta por calle (coordenadas fuera de la red vial)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Optimization/optimizeRoutes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originLocationId": 4202,
  "destinationLocationId": 4447,
  "unitIds": [2361],
  "stops": [{ "locationId": 4074 }]
}

### 13) 400 (validación): hora mal formada y objetivo inválido
POST {{baseUrl}}/Optimization/optimizeRoutes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originLocationId": 4202,
  "unitIds": [2361],
  "objective": "nada",
  "stops": [{ "locationId": 4074, "timeWindowStart": "9am" }]
}
